; KrishMix EA1 - Pinpoint Entry  |  attach per traded symbol
;
; Six independent ways to qualify for an entry. Turn the four add-on layers
; off and this is byte-for-byte the previous behaviour.
;   PULLBACK / BREAKOUT / REVERSAL   score driven, the original triggers
;   INSIDEBAR                        M30 swing-extreme inside-bar break, 1:3
;   FIBREV                           trend-based fib projection reached
;   PLAYBOOK                         the five-step top-down edge
;
; Orders carry a take profit and NEVER a stop loss. EA2/EA3/EA4 own what
; happens when price goes the other way.
;
; If it is not entering: InpDiagLogSeconds is already on, and the panel shows
; a histogram of every block reason with the dominant one marked "<== main".
; Tune that one condition, not everything at once.
;
; InpAdxTrendLevel MUST NOT exceed InpMinAdx, or every PULLBACK in the gap is
; silently refused. OnInit warns if you set it higher.
;
; InpFibTolerAtr 0.50 puts price "at" a projection fairly often. Tighten it to
; 0.25-0.35 if FIBREV produces more entries than you want.
;
; KEEP InpMagicBase IDENTICAL IN EVERY KrishMix EA.
InpMagicBase=51000
InpCommissionPerLot=0
InpSlippagePoints=30
InpLot=0.01
InpMaxPerDirection=1
InpAllowBoth=true
InpMinScore=35
InpRequireMtfAgree=true
InpMinAdx=18
InpAdxTrendLevel=18
InpSkipExtremeVol=true
InpMaxSpreadPoints=60
InpUsePullback=true
InpUseBreakout=true
InpUseReversal=true
InpReversalStretch=35
InpBreakoutAtrRatio=1.15
InpCooldownSeconds=300
InpOneEntryPerBar=true
InpDiagLogSeconds=0
InpTpMode=0
InpTpAtrMult=1.8
InpTpPrice=3
InpTpMoney=2
InpEmaFast=8
InpEmaSlow=21
InpEmaFilter=50
InpMtf1=15
InpMtf2=16385
InpAdxPeriod=14
InpRsiPeriod=14
InpAtrPeriod=14
InpDonchianPeriod=40
InpUseInsideBar=true
InpIbTimeframe=30
InpIbSellAtHigh=true
InpIbBuyAtLow=true
InpIbRewardRatio=3
InpIbRiskFromMother=true
InpIbMotherMinAtr=0.8
InpIbBabyMaxFrac=0.55
InpIbMaxAgeBars=6
InpIbExtremeLookback=12
InpUseFibRev=true
InpFibR1=0.618
InpFibR2=1
InpFibR3=1.618
InpFibMinImpulseAtr=2
InpFibMinRetracePct=20
InpFibMaxRetracePct=90
InpFibTolerAtr=0.5
InpFibRewardRatio=3
InpUsePlaybook=true
InpPbHighTf=16388
InpPbMidTf=15
InpPbLowTf=5
InpPbMinConfidence=55
InpPbRequireHtfAlign=false
InpPbMaPeriod=50
InpPbVwapMinSd=1.2
InpPbUseBusStyle=true
InpFreshTrendOnly=true
InpFreshMaturityMax=40
InpFreshCornerAtr=3
InpFreshMinRetrace=50
InpFreshFlipBars=25
InpFreshMaxLegs=5
InpFreshMaxExtAtr=12
InpSwingStrength=3
InpShowPanel=true
InpShowNarrative=true
